n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7-beta and `16bb065ac31b79c0ed24b3b944d3b5275123e854`\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid - Samsung Galaxy XR - Adreno 740\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using foveated rendering with Vulkan subsampled images on Samsung Galaxy XR, the content of composition layers will either be blank, or only at a resolution that is a subset of the full composition layer size\n\nUsing Vulkan subsampled images is a new feature in Godot 4.7 that is enabled by default, so I consider this a release blocker\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the [Meta Composition Layers sample](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/3386) from the [godot_openxr_vendors](https://github.com/godotvr/godot_openxr_vendors) project on a Samsung Galaxy XR\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Meta Composition Layers sample](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/3386) from the [godot_openxr_vendors](https://github.com/godotvr/godot_openxr_vendors) project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119225/reactions","t